  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Partnership with the Swedish Forest Agency within the framework of the Forest Initiative, 73000802. The aim of the partnership is to -   through increased collaboration between the authorities - strengthen  Sweden&apos;s role in the global work for sustainable management of forest resources and poverty reduction, in accordance to the Policy for      Global Development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1. Partnerskap med Skogsstyrelsen inom ramen f&#xf6;r Skogsinititivet,     73000802. M&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r &#xf6;verenskommelsen &#xe4;r att genom f&#xf6;rdjupad samverkan och samordning mellan myndigheterna st&#xe4;rka Sveriges roll i det        globala arbetet f&#xf6;r ett h&#xe5;llbart nyttjande av skogsresurser och       fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning i enlighet med PGU.</narrative>
  </description>
